<title>FRANCE: FMR/Fidelity has 6.27 pct in Pechiney.</title>
<headline>FMR/Fidelity has 6.27 pct in Pechiney.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French Bourses' Association SBF said that FMR Corp and Fidelity International Limited had informed the authorities that investment funds controlled by the companies had increased their stake in Pechiney on September 25.</p>
<p>They now own a total of 4.848.712 shares, or 6.27 percent of the capital.</p>
<p>The stake includes the interests of the Johnson family which has a 20 percent voting stake in FMR Corp and 47 percent in Fidelity International.</p>
</text>
